  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling activities to review and update the national implementation plan for the Stockholm Convention on Persistent Organic Pollutants (POPs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Enabling Activities (EA) is to update and review the National Implementation Plan (NIP), and have it endorsed and submitted by the government to the Stockholm Convention&apos;s Conference of Parties (COP). Participating stakeholders will be able to manage the additional POPs with newly developed technical skills, expertise and awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
